graph TD
    User -->|1 - Click Login| App
    App -->|2 - Redirect with client_id + scope| AuthServer[Authorization Server]
    AuthServer -->|3 - Show consent screen| User
    User -->|4 - Grant permission| AuthServer
    AuthServer -->|5 - Redirect with auth_code| App
    App -->|6 - Exchange code + client_secret| AuthServer
    AuthServer -->|7 - Return access_token + refresh_token| App
    App -->|8 - API request with Bearer token| ResourceServer[Resource Server]
    ResourceServer -->|9 - Validate token| AuthServer
    ResourceServer -->|10 - Return protected data| App
    App -->|11 - Display data| User

    style AuthServer fill:#ffb,stroke:#880
    style ResourceServer fill:#bfb,stroke:#080
    style App fill:#bbf,stroke:#008
